&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Projecció del documental: UP FROM THE STREETS - NEW ORLEANS: THE CITY OF MUSIC (2019)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Taller de paraigües decorats&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://bktbrassband.com"&gt;BKT Brass Band&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;C&lt;/strong&gt;oncert de &lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/zulu_men_band/"&gt;Zulu Men&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DJ &lt;a href="https://www.djlilkoko.com"&gt;Lil’ Koko&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>2023-08-02 - Intercanvi Internacional de Circ Barcelona 2023</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/08/03/2023-08-02-intercanvi-internacional-de-circ-barcelona-2023/</link><pubDate>Thu, 03 Aug 2023 00:00:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/08/03/2023-08-02-intercanvi-internacional-de-circ-barcelona-2023/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/gAUeAZBCqqfKZgp76"&gt;&lt;img src="https://blog.pocallum.cat/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/L1340335-Mejorado-NR-1024x576.jpg" alt=""&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tarda de Circ a la Plaça Ángel Pestaña amb els joves de l&amp;rsquo;Escola Infantil i Juvenil de Circ de l&amp;rsquo;Ateneu, la companyia &amp;ldquo;&lt;em&gt;Nido de las Artes&lt;/em&gt;&amp;rdquo; de Nicaragua i &amp;ldquo;&lt;em&gt;Circus Circuli&lt;/em&gt;&amp;rdquo; d&amp;rsquo;Stuttgart varen mostrar-nos les seves habilitats en aquest intercanvi entre joves d&amp;rsquo;arreu amb el punt en comú del Circ i les arts escèniques.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2023-06-21 - Ventanas abiertas - Finestres curioses - Ateneu Popular de Nou Barris</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/06/21/2023-06-21-ventanas-abiertas-finestres-curioses-ateneu-popular-de-nou-barris/</link><pubDate>Wed, 21 Jun 2023 00:00:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/06/21/2023-06-21-ventanas-abiertas-finestres-curioses-ateneu-popular-de-nou-barris/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/jMotStznZhnfLAhF6"&gt;&lt;img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/QFWERz-97JwNkHdu0Sy7-kSDgbrK_44kkNvAtJUr5Ez6EuvMf-v0yqCLmhzEjK3smlkJyTPOILrKhlSzoHJnhpnAst0aqQ76qZaVVgBYJm-JRFvOzhvEQzArt37VR4ZmnOyC-4b2a64yJSv5yt6wuOrjk3PfkQNkZ7ruJBggezXXG3l7PZvc1X_igjApXwQpJclPU7JCVsIoJB95ipKZQTTYJgINcVs_QSrgqXr21EiCVbLaOznBLmcZY5AWTqjSaI6RgK8JvoD4rp9FTZy0s6FPQ0CGP2LNQSMoyCNlJlHJwewuHK0ETiqtOIaT79D7i0yK-93Ut88UyXkrscc_8ncKKZ8GAts7k-O2Jsir7KEPv7XLTdjG1N_8YO2nwSeatOVx7lKXgrM_eqdhCDNiXSWNeHWymHUge6M4PtViZnuqvYp_6FRIgth5oGh3VETPh2E0CcdIr5TssUrsZ1RymIAwsyZPt-pP3G5l0HXEkWpOAylBz2X2wVEuGt6Kz-U1A1OJx0qFPOkE4TXQZVSLsLgiCZK9TUIz9A-R8_Ixeat9gwv1TawOaPLGpB2mCHavv-51ZnT2VoU5iC068px7Z0EAmV5e2u5n2ridKsE5I97g518oh1781lgV6LJ-Z2yNGDnl9ptx11sNMbYNOeW6DPyfAWzJr_i71edKjgwp8cKiCerYL7Ulw9E4mnm1Pv4Je2OEsJjlt35UXqB2tGNjmr23DaYwv2Hd4LQIGDAI1jBphKPMqF-rvRj6vFzmXKgRNS9WSevmpFuj4EcK7EMai1aNXw07YVZmxm6LVOjxZwXSRUiAXpf2LxFW41ehYrGSWckxnDZunzB8QwJxaszGHKTG0PQjTJTheHCiOLF8F6ssloQoMtBEuYQvwsoRfDGOaMN3cvkN1ufHI5vt8T6n8d3kO_7a0dmtu8Eie9uMjt5TTw=w1734-h1